        "headingId": 552,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The eighth-edition TNM staging system is used.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T11:33:17"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 514,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 553,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 70203,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 125,
        "headingId": 553,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Data regarding the behaviour of PSTT are limited. The available follow-up on three of four testicular tumours showed that two patients were alive after 3&nbsp;and 8&nbsp;years, and one patient developed metastasis 1&nbsp;month after orchiectomy {20381116; 9060597; 29395947}. One of two metastatic tumours had follow-up; the patient developed three recurrences over 27&nbsp;months of follow-up.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T11:33:17"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]